  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41123" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the development of agro-industrial parks in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to complement the government#s CAIP initiative through increasing investment in agriculture and agribusiness in Kenya. Interventions will focus on one selected agro-industrial park and will address business plan development, investment promotion, trade facilitation, and capacity building, leveraging international best practices including those from China. The project will seek synergy with the China-Africa-UNIDO Centre of Excellence (CoE) in Ethiopia, which provides services to the continent. Specifically, think tanks from China will be consulted in jointly preparing the pre-investment studies with Kenyan counterparts and UNIDO; investment promotion activities will be organized in the country, in the CoE in Ethiopia, and internationally; trade facilitation activities will be introduced with major global fairs in China and Kenya; collection centres around the CAIP will be refurbished and provided with storage and logistical technologies; and capacity building events will focus on management and operation capacities of government officials, referring to the regional and global experiences.</narrative>
  </description>
